ric [ref=e297]: 广东 · 楚地遗风\n                - paragraph [ref=e298]: 龙舟竞渡是端午节最具代表性的民俗活动，承载着对屈原的纪念和对美好生活的祈愿。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e299] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/dragon-boat\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e300]\n            - generic [ref=e302]:\n              - generic [ref=e303]:\n                - img \"剪纸\" [ref=e304]\n                - generic [ref=e306]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e307]:\n                  - heading \"剪纸\" [level=3] [ref=e308]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e309]: Paper Cutting\n              - generic [ref=e310]:\n                - generic [ref=e311]:\n                  - img [ref=e312]\n                  - generic [ref=e315]: 陕西 · 黄土高原\n                - paragraph [ref=e316]: 剪纸是中国最古老的民间艺术之一，用剪刀或刻刀在纸上剪刻花纹，寓意吉祥美好。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e317] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/paper-cutting\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e318]\n            - generic [ref=e320]:\n              - generic [ref=e321]:\n                - img \"京剧\" [ref=e322]\n                - generic [ref=e324]: 传统表演\n                - generic [ref=e325]:\n                  - heading \"京剧\" [level=3] [ref=e326]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e327]: Peking Opera\n              - generic [ref=e328]:\n                - generic [ref=e329]:\n                  - img [ref=e330]\n                  - generic [ref=e333]: 北京 · 京城古韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e334]: 京剧是中国影响最大的戏曲剧种，被誉为\"国粹\"，以唱念做打的表演方式闻名于世。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e335] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/peking-opera\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e336]\n            - generic [ref=e338]:\n              - generic [ref=e339]:\n                - img \"昆曲\" [ref=e340]\n                - generic [ref=e342]: 传统表演\n                - generic [ref=e343]:\n                  - heading \"昆曲\" [level=3] [ref=e344]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e345]: Kunqu Opera\n              - generic [ref=e346]:\n                - generic [ref=e347]:\n                  - img [ref=e348]\n                  - generic [ref=e351]: 江苏 · 姑苏雅韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e352]: 昆曲是中国最古老的戏曲剧种之一，被誉为\"百戏之祖\"，以典雅细腻的表演著称。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e353] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/kunqu-opera\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e354]\n            - generic [ref=e356]:\n              - generic [ref=e357]:\n                - img \"书法\" [ref=e358]\n                - generic [ref=e360]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e361]:\n                  - heading \"书法\" [level=3] [ref=e362]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e363]: Chinese Calligraphy\n              - generic [ref=e364]:\n                - generic [ref=e365]:\n                  - img [ref=e366]\n                  - generic [ref=e369]: 安徽 · 神州墨韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e370]: 书法是中国特有的艺术形式，以毛笔书写汉字，融合了文字、绘画与哲学的精髓。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e371] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/chinese-calligraphy\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e372]\n            - generic [ref=e176]:\n              - generic [ref=e177]:\n                - img \"苏绣\" [ref=e178]\n                - generic [ref=e180]: 传统工艺\n                - generic [ref=e181]:\n                  - heading \"苏绣\" [level=3] [ref=e182]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e183]: Suzhou Embroidery\n              - generic [ref=e184]:\n                - generic [ref=e185]:\n                  - img [ref=e186]\n                  - generic [ref=e189]: 江苏 · 江南水乡\n                - paragraph [ref=e190]: 苏绣是中国四大名绣之一，以精细雅洁著称，图案秀丽、针法活泼、色彩清雅。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e191] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/suzhou-embroidery\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e192]\n            - generic [ref=e194]: